<title>USA: Wesley Jessen files 4 mln share offering.</title>
<headline>Wesley Jessen files 4 mln share offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wesley Jessen VisionCare Inc filed for an offering of four million shares of its common stock, according to documents filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Most of the shares, 3.5 million, will be offered by selling shareholders. The company will sell 500,000 shares in the offering, according to the filing.</p>
<p>Shares closed at 24-10/16 on Tuesday but had not yet opened on Wednesday.</p>
